{"assets":["/statement-assets/9c5cc93bb21deccb71f69b651fc48ae2fc51923fc712f6e493d12e7b1e942602.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"721","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Road to Home"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Once Danil the student was returning home from tram stop lately by straight road of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"L"},{"kind":"text","text":". The stop is located at the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":", but the Danil's home — at the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = L"},{"kind":"text","text":". Danil goes from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = L"},{"kind":"text","text":" with a constant speed and does not change direction of movement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" street lights at the road, each of which lights some continuous segment of the road. All of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lightened segments do not share common points."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danil loves to sing, thus he wants to sing his favourite song over and over again during his walk. As soon as non-lightened segments of the road scare him, he sings only when he goes through the lightened segments."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danil passes distance "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" while performing his favourite song once. Danil can't start another performance if the segment passed while performing is not fully lightened. Moreover, if Danil has taken a pause between two performances, he is not performing while not having passed a segment of length at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". Formally,"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Danil can start single performance at a point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" only if every point of segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[x, x + p]"},{"kind":"text","text":" is lightened; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If Danil has finished performing at a point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x + p"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the next performance can be started only at a point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y = x + p"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y ≥ x + p + t"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfying the statement under the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9c5cc93bb21deccb71f69b651fc48ae2fc51923fc712f6e493d12e7b1e942602.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Blue half-circles denote performances. Please note that just after Danil has taken a pause in performing, he has not sang for a path of length of at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine how many times Danil can perform his favourite song during his walk from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = L"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note that Danil does not break a single performance, thus, started singing another time, he finishes singing when having a segment of length of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" passed from the performance start point."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains four integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"L"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ L ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ p ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ t ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the Danil's path, the number of street lights at the road, the distance Danil passes while doing single performance and the minimum distance of pause respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe segments lightened by street lights. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li, ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ li < ri ≤ L"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the endpoints of the segment lightened by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th street light. It is guaranteed that no two segments are intersecting, nesting, or touching each other. The segments are given in the order from left to right."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only integer — the maximum number of performances of Danil's favourite song on the path from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = L"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"17 2 2 6\n0 9\n13 17\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"12 2 2 2\n0 5\n6 11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"12 2 2 4\n0 5\n6 11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first sample case is just about corresponding to the picture from the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"721E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/721/problem/E"}